  "details": "I use SlimeVR and in Lock-All mode in this beta the spine is way too stretchy. Perhaps this works with vive trackers, but if there is any delay or inaccuracy it makes me look like a slinky. I'd prefer the old behavior of the neck just bending a bit.\n\nAttached is a video of me standing straight up and just bending my knees. While it looks hilarious, I'd rather this behavior not make it into live.\n\nhttps://imgur.com/TkAHA5T",
